      <h2 id="ossm-cr-example_ossm-reference" class="group scroll-mt-20">Service Mesh Control plane parameters<a href="#ossm-cr-example_ossm-reference" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p>The following table lists the top-level parameters for the <code>ServiceMeshControlPlane</code> resource.</p>
