      <TableCell>APIVersion defines the versioned schema of this representation of an object. Servers convert recognized schemas to the latest internal value, and may reject unrecognized values. The value for the <code>ServiceMeshControlPlane</code> version 2.0 is <code>maistra.io/v2</code>.</TableCell>
